Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it? What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼魂  恶魔  还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirit, demon, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-是什么  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是粘液  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, we're goo positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是精确科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like it's an exact science.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,老弟  搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说正经的  到底搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,随便说点什么也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One theory, any theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是谁  -我叫科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Name's Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我两次派驻伊拉克  特种部队  去过达尔富尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did two tours in Iraq. Special ops, Darfur...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your older brother, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我  是老相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...He and I, we go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作  就是猎杀怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do... is hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你有家人  科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a family, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们需要你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing they need you to come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要你完完整整地回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they need you to come back whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特杀了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester murdered my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你父亲  科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not your father, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of monster was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从没见过那种  之后也没再见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen that kind before, never seen it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,(北卡罗来纳州   费耶特维尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,(该隐血印)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看黄片呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  才不是  没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. I-it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会说你什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, no judgement from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是别在吃饭的地方看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, you know, not where we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们  不是黄片啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it wasn't porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,色情刊物  随便啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, "erotica." whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,裤链拉好  看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip it up. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(二等兵尸体被发现)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被害人受过近身格斗和柔道的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vic was trained in krav maga and jiu-jitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还是被放了血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still ended up with her organs drained,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而且骨髓完全被吸干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the marrow was sucked completely out of the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是食人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,食人怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking a rugaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,或是神祇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a god, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把西装翻出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go dig up my pencil-neck suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. W-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这对你还不够诡异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is this not weird enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是挺诡异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, it's weird, but, um, I mean, we... we...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那好  10分钟后车里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. 10 minutes. I'll meet you in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(该隐血印)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在看什么  不是黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing over there, and it ain't porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  我们什么网站都看遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, we have checked every website, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看两遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've checked it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  我们办案子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, when we work a case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到了一定时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's always that... that point...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就得面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we have to face the truth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,即便我们不喜欢这种现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现实就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西没得逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way around this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到了该隐的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw what happened to Cain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢  但我得继续生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not happy about it. But I got to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要继续做我们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna keep doing what we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我做不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能陪着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like you to be there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,(费耶特维尔除虫)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(费耶特维尔市政厅)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是联邦探员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents, I gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是从衣服看出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, was it the suits,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我们有股联调局的臭味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do we give off some sort of a Fed stench?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's the suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,二位有什么需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是前来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, we are here investigating
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,二等兵杰姬·普莱斯科特之死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the death of private Jacki Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,该死  你们专程从华盛顿赶来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot. You drove all the way down from D.C.?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那抱歉浪费你们时间了  探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then sorry to waste your time, agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但这案子已经结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we wrapped that one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,犯案的是个特种部队军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy that did it was a special forces officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,里克·威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么确定是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you so sure it was him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,仓库里到处是他的指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fingerprints were all over the storage room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他在基地一间仓库里动的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}out on the base where he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至把狗牌留在了尸体旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He even left his dog tags by the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他被关押了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is he in custody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  那混蛋喝下一大桶汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, bastard drank a boatload of gasoline,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自焚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then lit himself on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这么死可够惨烈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a hell of a way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是  留下个妻子和幼儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding. Left a wife and a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,六个月来第三起自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third suicide we seen in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,军事小镇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要来点蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-好啊  -算了  不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - No, uh, y-you know what? Uh, we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃的  我搭档做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's really good. My partner made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去很棒  不过我们不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks great, but we're... no, we're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we do have one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体上有咬痕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there any bite marks found on the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  凶器是猎刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Vic was killed with a bowie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,警长  多谢配合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sheriff, thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没有咬痕  那么不是食人怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bite marks. That rules out rugaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是神祇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? A god?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙自焚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy molotov-cocktailed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,像是被恶魔附体了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like demon-possession bonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是里克干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想狡辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to say that he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚刚派驻归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he just got back from deployment,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道那对士兵能造成什么样的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've all seen what it can do to a soldier's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我的里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他回到家  精神很好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}...when he's home and good...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛都得靠我打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to kill the spiders, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,里克很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick was a kind soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他从未杀过不该杀的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never took more life than he had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前有没有注意到什么奇怪之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you, um, notice anything strange, weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,比如情绪暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, uh... violent mood swings?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,或者怪味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or weird smells?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,里克...很...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Rick was... he was so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他很渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,渴什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirsty for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他会把大半天花在用花园水管喝水上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd spend half the day drinking from the garden hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,后来  还有一晚  我发现他在浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one night, I caught him in the tub
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喝洗澡水\N{\fnArial\fs30}drinking the bathwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told him to stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他简直像听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was like he couldn't even hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他的皮肤干燥很严重  都流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his skin, it got so dry it bled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他去见医生了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he see a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我带他去了退伍军人协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took him to the V.A.,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但他却只能一等再等\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he just got on a list to get on a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,后来他不再说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, he stopped talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经完全失常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just wasn't himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是创伤后应激障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe it was PTSD.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,请节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你说里克刚从派驻归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that Rick was recently deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,知道他被派驻去哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  那都是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that stuff is classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,妻子都不能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't even let the wives in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we'll, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不打扰了  如果你想到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave you alone now, but if something comes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,任何东西  请打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything at all, just give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我在超市碰到了朋友杰玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran into my friend Jemma at the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她嫁给了基特·维森  里克的队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's married to Kit Verson, a guy from Rick's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得基特这次回来也变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks Kit came back different this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们似乎遇到了一样的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of felt like we were dealing with the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,基特的确有些烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit's been going through some stuff for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you know, it takes him a while
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-是需要时间的  他总能恢复  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to get back to normal, but he always does. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢  你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you? How are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,基本没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为里克和贝丝的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what happened to Rick and Beth, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让人很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏上帝仁慈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There but for the grace of god," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可以跟你丈夫谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we speak with your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他昨晚出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, um... he went out last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he should be back any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,基特派驻归来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Kit, he comes back from these deployments,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,总是需要空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he needs his space.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他出去了一整晚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's been out all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我都骗不了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even convince myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我好担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这不像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他最近很渴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he been thirsty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,会跟狗抢水那么渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}like "drink out of the dog bowl" thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,认出了你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognized your wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,杰玛打给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jemma called me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是新兵蛋子时就认识基特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known Kit since we were military brats
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在同一个基地待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}raisin' hell on the same base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没人说他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one's saying he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你们是冲着杰玛的茶来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you two, uh, here for, Jemma's sweet tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要告诉我你们究竟为什么而来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me why you're really here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在查案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,基特的案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kit's case?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说  我们还不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, we're not sure just yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但看上去是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, it's looking like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,镇上发生了一起谋杀-自杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a murder-suicide in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友基特跟凶手是队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your buddy Kit? Same unit as the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而且有同样的怪毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same whacked-out antics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're not going anywhere, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你在乎你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you care about your buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我们来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll let us handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是跟你们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I think I'm gonna be coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识人  我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got contacts. I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮不上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比如  我有个朋友是军队情报机构的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, a friend of mine works military intelligence...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}owes me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他会知道里克和基特执行了什么任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would he know what Rick and Kit's mission was?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  而且他会告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. And he'd tell me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我能猜到是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I figure what's going on here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死死跟着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stick to you two like flies on roadkill,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,确保我朋友能完好无损地回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure my buddy comes home in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know what you two are thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不能猎杀我的好哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are not gonna hunt my best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是个战争英雄呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happens to be a frigging war hero, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是有区别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  我们也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, we're right there with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-基特是个英雄  -但你得做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kit's a hero, but... - But you got to prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,基特可以已经不是自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit might not be Kit anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,先生  你得先付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you have to pay for that first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧你干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look what you ma--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有个家伙闯了进来  快回商店来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy just came in. Get to the store, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,食物来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sustenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我查不到牛死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got nothing on cattle deaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,或是诡异天气  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}freakish weather... none of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那或许不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... probably not a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,或许根本不是你们那种案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe it's just not your kind of thing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,化疑虑为食欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when in doubt...eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(发送者  未知  查看)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(加密邮件)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到一封军队情报机构那个朋友发来的密信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an encrypted e-mail here from my friend at the M.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,基特和里克被派去营救一名美国战俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit and Rick were sent to rescue an American P.O.W.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他被关押在伊拉克纳贾夫公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}being held in Iraq... the Najaf cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cemetery?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那些混蛋把那里当做监狱用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastards use 'em as a, uh... as a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有一段视频  是威利斯头盔摄像头拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some footage here from the camera on Willis' helmet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟基特执行的最后一桩任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}during his last mission with Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,琼斯少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Jones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,马特·琼斯少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Matt Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-那边  -琼斯少校  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, right here. - Hey, major Jones, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是基特·维森上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm captain Kit Verson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来救你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to bring you home, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.89,0:15:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜结局很不堪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that didn't have a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.77,0:15:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  任务失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it did not. Mission failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,战俘被警卫射杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that P.O.W. got shot by guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  就是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,官方是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the official story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,基特和里克回来都有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, Kit and Rick came back screwed-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这我们是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,里克发了疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, and then Rick jumped the high dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我设置手机接收本地警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set my phone to get local alerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.55,0:16:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不妙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他舔了地板上的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He licked the blood off the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个汽水小哥似乎吓得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the soda jockey back there seemed pretty shook up by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他给出的描述  中等身材  棕色头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the description he gave... medium build, brown hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去像是基特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound like the Kit you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it does. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还觉得不像我们那种案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So still sound like it ain't our kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杰玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔  新闻上说有人被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole, uh, the news said someone was killed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在肯顿街的加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the gas 'n sip on Kenton.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  我在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I'm here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what are they saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么消息  杰玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much. Look, Jem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没法多说  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I really can't talk right now. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们认为是...基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they think that he... that... that Kit...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是他  他现在不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he did, he isn't in his right mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的  科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know that, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你得救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是现在唯一让我不至于发疯的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the only thing keeping me sane right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想  有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking, you know, sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,基特想单独待着时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Kit wanted to be alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他会去北边  他父亲的老木屋住\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would head up north to his dad's old cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你可以去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could go check it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我待在家  以防他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and... and... and I'll stay here in case he comes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,功夫小子  来不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kung-fu grip, you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰玛  我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jem, I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去10英里范围内的每一家警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hit every cop shop within a 10-mile radius,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到处问问  看能不能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}put the word out, see if we can't track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们找到了他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you find him, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,基特需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吃枪子  不是挨刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't need a bullet, and he doesn't need a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know what, cole?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你想保护你朋友  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you want to protect your buddy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他成了怪物  我们只能干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's a monster... we got to put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只能如此  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way it's gonna have to be, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,职责所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你加不加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you in or out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢送我一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better this way, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你安抚住她  我们有消息告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep her calm. We'll keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他如果出现了  别逞英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shows up, don't try and be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,亏你还给他买了晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you bought him dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,基特  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kit? Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是科尔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有几个很厉害的角色在找你  基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some real serious people looking for you, Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可不仅仅是想找你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they won't just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,情况很糟糕  基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad, Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要么面对我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's either me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就得面对他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西...我咽下去个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something went down my...throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.15,0:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  科尔  试着镇定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cole, just try and stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-天呐  -科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, god. - Cole?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西在动  它是活的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something moved. It's alive, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我们会把它弄出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we're gonna get it out of you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么弄  -我们会找到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How?! - We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  你单枪匹马来这里真是太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that was a dumbass move coming here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  我本该让"砍刀兄弟"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. I should have let the machete brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来把我朋友的头砍掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut my buddy's head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.24,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你真让我们那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在也不会咽下去一只肉虫王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you wouldn't be choking down a damn khan worm right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肉虫王是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a khan worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得是那玩意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是它的变种亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some sort of freak cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.46,0:22:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西的变种亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak cousin of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,几年前  迪恩和我办过一起案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple years back, Dean and I worked a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们和这种虫子一起被困在一个罐头厂里(S06E16)\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got stuck in a cannery with this worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它会钻进人的身体然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would get into people's bodies and --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这虫子可讨厌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was freaking awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那你们以前遇到过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so you've been to this rodeo before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:22:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么杀死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最坏的情况  得把虫子的宿主爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst case -- headshot the person it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后虫子就会爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worm crawls out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一脚踩死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we stomp it like a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有一种办法是你不爆我头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a version where you don't cap me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有的  上一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,电击迫使这虫子离开了人体\N{\fnArial\fs30}electrocution made the worm leave the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  就电击吧  我奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine. Electrocution it is. I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  你俩开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You two get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go look for Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-萨姆  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, Sammy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,假如能把我治好  那基特也有救  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can fix me, we can save Kit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.43,0:23:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这会疼得你哭爹喊娘吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that this is gonna hurt like a son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,靠  我有妻有子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I have a wife, a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还有乱七八糟的按揭要管\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an upside-down mortgage to get back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.31,0:23:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes, Dean-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:23:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次你遇见这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, last time you saw this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.44,0:24:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它也是把普通人变成了杀人狂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turned people into killers, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  只不过那一只还控制了我们的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except that one did a mind-control number on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.78,0:24:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,日复一日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day in, day out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and Sammy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.53,0:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救人们免受灵异事物的侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving people from things they just can't wrap their minds around...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.37,0:24:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至都没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, and nobody even notices it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我做的贡献还能赢个奖章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, at least I get a medal for my efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.18,0:24:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我还试图杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  真愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点就把你干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost took you off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.87,0:24:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在还有谁能来救我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would be saving me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.14,0:24:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我们还是别整的这么煽情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, let's not get too sentimental about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.81,0:24:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们把这东西发动起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's fire this puppy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的好像这不过是普通的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you say that like it's just another Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄  今天才周一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, buddy, it's only Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.28,0:25:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.27,0:25:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次  它是从我们耳朵里出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, it came out of our ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.29,0:25:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没看见有东西出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not seeing anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.26,0:25:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  那混蛋这会儿该爬出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that sucker should have crawled out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.14,0:25:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我继续的话  会害死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep going, this is gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.79,0:26:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔  别这样  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole! Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.18,0:26:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.43,0:26:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.79,0:26:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  我们不能再玩"手术游戏"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're done playing "Operation."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我再电你  你就要被电死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I zap you again, you're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,休息下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take a knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.73,0:27:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么样了  -虫子没出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did it go? - Worm was a no-show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.22,0:27:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这不科学啊  上次...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make any sense. Last time --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.91,0:27:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这次是这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this ain't the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.98,0:27:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这是一种全新的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe this is a whole new species, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道电击是不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that sparky struck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.75,0:27:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,万物都有弱点  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, everything has a weakness, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.18,0:27:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢  有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about you? Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.03,0:27:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要去基特家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to Kit's.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该先去那查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd check there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  抓紧了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well... hurry up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.03,0:27:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.53,0:27:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,力不从心就是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what in over your head looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,保持注意力就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to keep your head in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  关于这玩意儿我们知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what do we know about this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.61,0:27:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它会吸走你体内的水分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sucker dries you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.61,0:27:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在已经口干舌躁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thirsty already, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.29,0:27:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它喜欢水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It likes water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:27:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,当水无法满足它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when that's not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.58,0:28:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就是血  我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,缺水或许会让这东西暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe lack of fluids makes the thing hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就和寄生虫一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's like a parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.57,0:28:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干你的水分  然后寻找下一个寄主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wrings you dry, and then it moves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果我让自己脱水\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I dry myself out,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.88,0:28:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这鬼东西就不那么喜欢我了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the son of a bitch wouldn't like that very much, now, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.96,0:28:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对  它就会想出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he'd want the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.22,0:28:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是恶劣环境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be a hostile environment --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.48,0:28:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你这人一直都凶巴巴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, more than you already are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.04,0:28:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这么说  你没见过我和气时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be fair, you really haven't seen my chiller side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.74,0:28:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得快速脱水怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think about rapid dehydration?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.23,0:28:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,爱死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.72,0:28:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,它出来以后  你可别放过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure you squash that sucker when it goes awol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.73,0:28:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这计划不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.66,0:28:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,林中蒸汗屋最棒了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like a sweat lodge in the woods, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.64,0:29:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.14,0:29:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.75,0:29:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.89,0:29:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生了什么  无论你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened, whatever you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.59,0:29:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都能解决  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fix this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能把你治好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.98,0:29:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,基特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:30:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,基特  停下  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kit, stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.14,0:30:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't...stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.50,0:30:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们搞起了蒸汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a... sweat lodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.84,0:30:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是你说的  任何东西都有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're the one who said everything has got a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.89,0:30:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,出点汗  如果能杀了这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I figure take a schvitz, kill a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.15,0:30:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那也算不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call that a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能奏效的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do, actually, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道如何结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  B计划就是杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, plan "B" For "bullet."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.96,0:30:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们现在还不能放弃  你先撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not quite there yet, so just hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.77,0:30:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.97,0:30:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他妻子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.90,0:30:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她快崩溃了  科尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's barely holding on. How's Cole?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.91,0:31:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  基特快醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, Kit is gonna come to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.87,0:31:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我赶到的时候  他的情况已经很糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I got here, it was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.61,0:31:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,时间紧迫  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the clock. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.89,0:31:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.58,0:31:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,接着流汗  伙计  你做得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep sweating, man. You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,基特最后一次和里克一起执行的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Kit's last mission, on his deployment with Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was an incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.51,0:31:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西进入了基特的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something got inside Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, h-have you seen anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.58,0:31:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, y-- I saw something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.66,0:31:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it -- it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.55,0:32:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真真切切  活生生的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a real-life, actual, honest-to-god monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.15,0:32:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.81,0:32:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,被它改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.83,0:32:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.21,0:32:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.15,0:32:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸也是被什么东西控制了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad...he got something inside him, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.72,0:32:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他转化时  也是如此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is what he felt like when he turned?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.76,0:32:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:33:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但变成怪物前  他也曾是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was human before he was... a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.78,0:33:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.75,0:33:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么那么做了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you did it, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.08,0:33:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他当时已经不再是我爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad wasn't my dad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我和他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go down that same road...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你也能一样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to do that to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.85,0:33:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That road?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.36,0:33:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.38,0:33:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得你也会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think that's where you're headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.59,0:33:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是想反了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you've got it ass-backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.57,0:33:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你得用尽全部的力量去反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna fight harder than you ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.07,0:33:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.26,0:33:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能把我绑在这椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you do me the honor of tying me to this chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.69,0:34:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,得了  我们都知道你不会下手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We both know you're not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.43,0:34:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你得坚持到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna sweat this one through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.50,0:34:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.80,0:34:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.80,0:34:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想想你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about your family, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.79,0:34:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你的妻子  孩子  听到我说的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife, your kid. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.22,0:34:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的鼓励  教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the talk, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但说实话  我满脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But honestly, all I can think about
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就只有割开你的手腕  痛饮你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}is slicing your wrist and drinking you like a fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.16,0:35:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这就意味着我是个怪物  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that makes me a monster, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.99,0:35:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - And...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.55,0:35:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我得花点时间消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. This is gonna take me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.03,0:35:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.32,0:35:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,很疯狂  对吗  听起来很疯狂  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy, right? It sounds crazy? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.37,0:35:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但这就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.07,0:35:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if he's
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.24,0:35:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是你说的那样  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you say he is, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.15,0:35:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰玛  他试图杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jemma, he tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.78,0:35:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着他双眼时  看到的还是你老公吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that your husband when you looked into his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.50,0:35:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你认识的基特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that the Kit you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  迪恩在努力解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...Dean is working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.56,0:35:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩和科尔会弄明白的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and Cole will figure it out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.85,0:35:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我打电话确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me check in with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.78,0:35:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.07,0:36:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.81,0:37:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  萨姆  接电话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy! Pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.21,0:37:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我扣扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me pull this trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.04,0:37:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.87,0:37:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.53,0:37:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.82,0:38:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  我们成功了  科尔没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, we did it. Cole's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.21,0:38:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快点把基特送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Kit over here as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.85,0:38:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.25,0:38:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever it's worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望结果不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wish it hadn't ended this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.65,0:38:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我也是  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me, too, Sammy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,基特  他当时想杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Kit -- he was gonna kill her and --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.30,0:39:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  杰玛都告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Jemma told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,士兵发了疯  攻击了他老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solider goes crazy, attacks his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.71,0:39:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她不得不杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.42,0:39:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,至少这是她得说出去的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least that's the story that she's got to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我现在都见识到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I've seen it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.78,0:39:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一部分  不是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some. Not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.48,0:39:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想回家  见我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go home, see my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.04,0:39:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想感谢你  迪恩  谢谢你救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank you, Dean-o, for keeping me standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.17,0:39:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要一点血一点汗  再多点汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all it took was a little blood, sweat, and, uh, more sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好自己  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of yourself, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.57,0:39:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是希望以后再也不用见到你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still hope I don't see the two of you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.91,0:40:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.54,0:40:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别为基特的事责怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame yourself for Kit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住  迪恩  感觉糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help it, Dean. It feels crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.99,0:40:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.92,0:40:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.49,0:40:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了  只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't save this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.42,0:40:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候  你什么都做对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you can do everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.46,0:40:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even still, sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.84,0:40:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那人还是救不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy still dies.

